<title>FINLAND: METAL WORKERS UNION SAYS BACKS FINNISH EMU ENTRY.</title>
<headline>METAL WORKERS UNION SAYS BACKS FINNISH EMU ENTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The council of the Finnish Metal Workers Union on Tuesday approved a resolution saying Finland should be ready to join European economic and monetary union EMU, the union said in a statement.</p>
<p>The council voted in favour of the EMU resolution by 49-9.</p>
</text>
